      en: ["The area has been under official protection since 1878.", "The core of the virgin forest covers about 1,600 hectares.", "Some individual trees exceed 500 years in age.", "A total of 86 different tree species have been identified.", "The reserve spans elevations from 850 to 2,122 meters.", "It is one of the three last virgin forests on the European continent."],
