      en: ["The highest peak, Zubački kabao, reaches 1,894 meters.", "Home to the highest rainfall in Europe (up to 5,000 mm annually).", "The most important refuge for Heldreich's pine in Montenegro.", "Hosts an above-average number of local endemic species.", "Rugged karst landscape featuring extremely deep sinkholes.", "Botanical transition zone between the Mediterranean and the Alps."],
